35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The ledger shows seventy percent of costs are fixed, like hall hire. That is a lot.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The sign-in sheets show a quarter of members do two-thirds of the work.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The rota confirms it. The same nine people set up and lock up.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Chasing individual payments took six hours a month. That is too much for one person.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Nine people left the taster evening because they did not want a whole year commitment.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, if chasing money takes so long, a flat fee might be simpler for the books.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, if only nine people do the work, should they pay less? Or more?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, if they do the work, they should not be penalized for showing up.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, a flat fee is easier to collect, but does it cover the fixed costs fairly?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mio, if we charge per event, the quiet members might feel even more excluded.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,The bank statements show many people needed reminders. A single annual payment might help.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The weekday turnout dropped when we had door charges. People stopped feeling it was theirs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I think a tiered system might work. Those who do more can choose a higher level.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The mid-year joiners needed hand-worked calculations. That is a hassle for the treasurer.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,The winter social feedback says quiet members are uneasy about per-event costs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I am leaning towards a flat fee to keep the books simple and predictable.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I worry a flat fee might not encourage the quiet members to come out more.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"A tiered system could let the heavy users pay more, but it might create friction.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I prefer the simplicity of a flat fee for the treasurer's sake.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I think a flat fee is the most welcoming for newcomers who are unsure.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
