60,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option A is a flat annual fee. It covers everything and is simple to collect.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Option B is tiered membership. It lets people choose their level of participation.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Option C is activity-based. A small base fee plus a charge for each event attended.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,I have seen the options. I am ready to vote based on what we discussed.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Kenji,,I have read the options. I think we should choose the one that is most inclusive.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, does the flat fee address the treasurer's time issue?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, would tiered membership make the quiet members feel more comfortable?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, does the flat fee account for the uneven workload we found?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, yes, the flat fee reduces the chasing of individual payments significantly.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, I think the flat fee is the most welcoming for those who are unsure.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,I think the flat fee is the best balance of simplicity and fairness.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I am concerned about the quiet members, but I will support the flat fee.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"I would prefer a tiered system, but I see the logic in the flat fee.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I vote for the flat fee. It is the most sustainable for the committee.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I vote for the flat fee. It keeps the door open for everyone.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
